  "details": "There are many with the same problem but it is a big issue when you start a public lobby you expect to have the power to remove anybody by kicking them that is not the case it makes it worse when you are unable to vote kick someone that is playing unfair using a modded client or overall harassing other players with no way to remove them from the lobby forcing people to make private lobbies to enjoy the worlds game you could block or mute them but they will still be in the lobby impacting the lobby with whatever they do let the vote kick amount be lowered instead of having it to be a nearly full lobby.",
